},{"id":1777558924430,"text":"他把你家打量了一圈，然后视线落在厨房门口，言简意该地问：“在哪听到的？”","rawContent":"他把你家打量了一圈，然后视线落在厨房门口，言简意该地问：“在哪听到的？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:25","timestamp":1777559159918,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":215},{"id":1777558924431,"text":"他径直走向厨房，打开收纳箱，拿出里面的工具，然后蹲下身，开始仔细检查水槽下面和冰箱后面的缝隙。他的动作很专注，像是在处理一件再正常不过的工作。","rawContent":"他径直走向厨房，打开收纳箱，拿出里面的工具，然后蹲下身，开始仔细检查水槽下面和冰箱后面的缝隙。他的动作很专注，像是在处理一件再正常不过的工作。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559164439,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":216},{"id":1777558924432,"text":"你站在他身后，有点手足无措，只能把手电筒递给他。","rawContent":"你站在他身后，有点手足无措，只能把手电筒递给他。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559168892,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":217},{"id":1777558924433,"text":"他回头接过，指尖无意中擦过你的手背，很凉。他顿了一下，然后才开口，语气是命令式的，但并不凶。","rawContent":"他回头接过，指尖无意中擦过你的手背，很凉。他顿了一下，然后才开口，语气是命令式的，但并不凶。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559173406,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":218},{"id":1777558924434,"text":"“你躲远点，去客厅待着。”他头也不回地继续检查墙角，“别一会儿真跑出来吓到你。”","rawContent":"“你躲远点，去客厅待着。”他头也不回地继续检查墙角，“别一会儿真跑出来吓到你。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559177920,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":219},{"id":1777558924435,"text":"厨房里只剩下他翻找东西的细微声响。大概过了十几分钟，他站起身，拍了拍手上的灰。","rawContent":"厨房里只剩下他翻找东西的细微声响。大概过了十几分钟，他站起身，拍了拍手上的灰。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559182447,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":220},{"id":1777558924436,"text":"“没找到。”他看着你，得出结论。“可能已经跑了，也可能是楼上的声音。”","rawContent":"“没找到。”他看着你，得出结论。“可能已经跑了，也可能是楼上的声音。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559186971,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":221},{"id":1777558924437,"text":"他没多说，只是默默地在厨房和客厅的角落里布置好粘鼠板，又在捕鼠笼里放上他带来的花生酱诱饵。","rawContent":"他没多说，只是默默地在厨房和客厅的角落里布置好粘鼠板，又在捕鼠笼里放上他带来的花生酱诱饵。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559191499,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":222},{"id":1777558924438,"text":"做完这一切，他把空箱子收好，站到玄关准备离开。","rawContent":"做完这一切，他把空箱子收好，站到玄关准备离开。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559195805,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":223},{"id":1777558924439,"text":"“这几天先这样。”他看着你，眼神很认真，“再听到声音就发消息给我，别自己硬扛。”","rawContent":"“这几天先这样。”他看着你，眼神很认真，“再听到声音就发消息给我，别自己硬扛。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559200329,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":224},{"id":1777558924440,"text":"他停顿了一下，手已经放到了门把上，又补了一句。","rawContent":"他停顿了一下，手已经放到了门把上，又补了一句。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559204335,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":225},{"id":1777558924441,"text":"“我住得不远。”","rawContent":"“我住得不远。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559206470,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":226},{"id":1777558924442,"text":"说完，他拉开门，没有回头地走了出去。","rawContent":"说完，他拉开门，没有回头地走了出去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:26","timestamp":1777559210942,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":227},{"id":1777558924443,"sender":"them","type":"offline_invite","text":"","offlineInvite":{"type":"this-moment","scenario":"深夜上门解决老鼠问题"},"timestamp":1777559210977,"roundId":"round_1777559080319_mtsygcdng","offlineInviteResponded":"declined","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":228},{"id":1777558924444,"sender":"me","type":"offline_invite_response","offlineInviteResponse":"declined","text":"","offlineInvite":{"type":"this-moment","scenario":"深夜上门解决老鼠问题"},"timestamp":1777559219253,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":229},{"id":1777558924445,"text":"（等你走之后我拿起手机犹豫了一会点了回关）","sender":"me","time":"22:27","timestamp":1777559267563,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":230},{"id":1777558924446,"text":"那个，今晚，谢谢你了","sender":"me","time":"22:27","timestamp":177755